<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Integration API tokens · RustDesk</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/css/admin.css?v=3.0.1"></head>
<body>{{template "shell.tmpl" .}}
<main id="content"><h1>Integration API tokens</h1><p>Allow another system to create single-use links with <code>POST /api/webclient/access-tokens</code>. These tokens authorize access-link creation only. Remote hosts still require their password or approval.</p>
{{if .Error}}<p class="notice error" role="alert">{{.Error}}</p>{{end}}{{if .Message}}<p class="notice" role="status">{{.Message}}</p>{{end}}
{{if .Token}}<section><h2>Copy your token now</h2><p>The full token is shown only once. Store it in your integration's secret storage.</p><div class="filters"><label>New API token<input readonly aria-label="New API token" value="{{.Token}}" autocomplete="off"></label></div></section>{{end}}
<p><a href="https://github.com/slxar/rustdesk-api-goravel/blob/main/docs/integration-api.md" rel="noreferrer">Integration API documentation and examples</a></p>
<section><h2>Create integration token</h2><form method="post" action="/_admin/integration-tokens"><input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{.CsrfToken}}"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="create"><div class="filters"><label>Name<input name="name" required maxlength="80" placeholder="Support portal"></label><label>Allowed RustDesk IDs<input name="targets" required maxlength="7000" placeholder="123456789, 987654321"></label></div><p>Separate IDs with commas or spaces. Enter <code>*</code> explicitly to permit any host your account can share.</p><div class="filters"><label>Expires in days<input name="days" type="number" min="1" max="365" value="90" required></label><button>Create API token</button></div></form></section>
<section><h2>Issued tokens</h2><div class="table-wrap" tabindex="0" role="region" aria-label="Issued integration tokens"><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Token prefix</th><th>Allowed IDs</th><th>Expires (UTC)</th><th>Last used (UTC)</th><th>Status</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody>{{range .Tokens}}<tr><td>{{.Name}}</td><td><code>{{.Prefix}}…</code></td><td>{{.Targets}}</td><td>{{.Expires}}</td><td>{{.LastUsed}}</td><td>{{.Status}}</td><td>{{if .Active}}<form method="post" action="/_admin/integration-tokens"><input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{$.CsrfToken}}"><input type="hidden" name="action" value="revoke"><input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{.ID}}"><button>Revoke {{.Name}}</button></form>{{end}}</td></tr>{{else}}<tr><td colspan="7">No integration tokens yet.</td></tr>{{end}}</tbody></table></div></section>
<p>Send the token using <code>Authorization: Bearer YOUR_TOKEN</code> and JSON such as <code>{"id":"123456789","expires_in":300}</code>. Revocation also invalidates links and browser sessions created using the token.</p></main></div></body></html>
